From 0000000000000000000000000000000000009012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MinsOS <minsos@local>
Date: Sun, 19 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] create work profiles without the Knox key attestation (One UI 9, y2q)

Settings mod 9012-oneui85 (492de9d, I-73) re-derived on the S928N UserManagerService.
createUserInternalUncheckedNoTracing attests a key named KnoxTestKeyUMS before it creates an
enterprise (work) profile. The A13 vendor keymint rejects the new Samsung attestation tag, the
attestation returns no certificate chain, the branch logs "Device integrity status is abnormal.",
finds no engineering-mode token and returns null, so the profile is never created.

Jump from :cond_3b (where both DRK branches meet, outside every try block) to :goto_29, the label
the success path reaches after AttestationUtils.deleteKey. On One UI 9 the 8.5 label :goto_2a is a
different place further down, so the tablet patch cannot be copied. The new edge carries the state
of the :cond_42 edge (the one that skips the whole check) except v0, v6, v8 and v9; after :goto_29
v0 and v6 are written before any read (try_1c/try_1d), v8 before its first read (isEphemeral), v9
before its first read (move-object/from16 v9, v22 or p9), and the catchall_4/catchall_9 handlers
read none of them. The isKnoxKeyInstallable check before it still runs.
---
--- a/smali_classes2/com/android/server/pm/UserManagerService.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/android/server/pm/UserManagerService.smali
@@ -7061,6 +7061,12 @@
     return-object p1
 
     :cond_3b
+    # MinsOS: skip the Knox key attestation that gates an enterprise (work) profile. The A13 vendor
+    # keymint returns no certificate chain for it, so every work profile failed with "Device integrity
+    # status is abnormal." (Shelter, pm create-user --managed; I-73 on the T970). :goto_29 is where the
+    # check continues when it passes (the goto after AttestationUtils.deleteKey). Only v0/v6/v8/v9 differ
+    # from the :cond_42 edge that already lands there, and each is written again before it is read.
+    goto :goto_29
     :try_start_19
     const-string v0, "KnoxTestKeyUMS"
     :try_end_19
